## What We Are Building

Two things, one underneath the other.

**Layer 1 (the visible work):** restore the user-level `~/.claude/` harness (skills/commands/agents/rules/memory/plugins) that did NOT survive the laptop move — only the git-tracked repo `.claude/` did. Then trim it to what this repo needs, and fix a flaky test that made the suite read as an intermittent regression.

**Layer 0 (the real work, the Director's framing):** the project's strategy had silently died — `NORTH_STAR.md` (the Star = one goal + planets) and `PLANET.md` (the current planet) were written 2026-06-27 and never re-read, so `PLAN.md` absorbed everything and swelled to ~657 lines while the "current planet" drifted 17 episodes behind reality. The goal is to rebuild the anchor system AND wire it so it can't decay again — the "mechanism that builds the mechanism." Director's model: one Star (goal = autonomous AI film factory; human = creative at series/episode concept + training), many Planets (big tasks: Autonomy, Reliability, Quality, Creativity, Cost, Distribution, Measurement, Self-learning, Scalability), and an anti-drift discipline where the partner names the planet before work, parks tangents, and forces a conscious choice to leave the line.

