## What WORKED (with evidence)

- **ECC layer restored** — confirmed by: `~/.claude/` now has 72 skills, 65 commands, 29 agents, 15 rules, 94 session-data handoffs, 130 memory files + 18 archive; `/save-session` etc. present. Slash-commands and skills showed up live in the session's available list.
- **Context audit / trim** — confirmed by: measured passive start cost 16 800 → 12 556 tok after moving 92 items to `~/.claude/*-library/` (reversible `Move-Item`). Key finding: session-data/memory BODIES cost 0 passive tokens; only descriptions load.
- **Flaky test fix — commit `2a55c1b7`** — confirmed by: full suite `npm test` = 1415/1415 (129/129 files), was 1412/1415; `tsc` clean; `replay-pilot` 30/30. Root cause: 4 PA-tool test files did `await import('@/lib/concierge/tools')` (287 KB barrel, ~1.2s) INSIDE the 5s testTimeout → failed under worker contention. Fixed by hoisting to static top-level import (no vi.mock present, so lazy import guarded nothing). Test time also fell 40.7s→24.2s.
- **Layer 0 anchors built — commit `99ea6d11`** — NORTH_STAR.md v1 ratified by Director, PLANET.md (planet = Autonomy), CLAUDE.md §9 ritual now reads NORTH_STAR→PLANET→PLAN→glossary, §12 Ritual 2 prose extended.
- **F2 staleness hook now REAL — commit `5956c67a`** — confirmed by: `plan-md-staleness-check.cjs` now checks PLAN.md AND PLANET.md; verified via temp PROJECT_ROOT runs: stale PLANET → WARN + exit 1 (both with and without a UTF-8 BOM), fresh PLANET → silent exit 0, PLAN.md path still warns on old date. Regex matches real PLANET.md header (`выбрана 2026-07-20`).
- **Anchor mode-consistency** — confirmed by: grep shows NORTH_STAR ("живые режимы 1/2/3" + "Горизонт — Mode 9"), CLAUDE.md §6 (ruling banner + Mode 9 ABSOLUTE row + 2.5/4 DEPRECATED), PLANET (no mode number, behavioural) all agree.

