## Decisions Made

- **NORTH_STAR / PLANET / PLAN three-tier anchors** — reason: Director's model — one immutable Star (shown-whole before any edit), one current Planet, PLAN.md as operations only. Wired into §9/§12 + staleness hook so they can't decay like the 2026-06-27 pair did.
- **Current planet = Autonomy** — reason: Director — reliability/quality are unmeasurable while hand-fixing masks true behavior; autonomy is the substrate that makes the other planets measurable.
- **Autonomy metric = ZERO unplanned (bug-fixing) Director touches**, not a touch count — reason: ~10-12 planned creative gates (brief, script-read, casting, pilots, final→publish) are fine; what breaks autonomy is unplanned hand-repair.
- **Modes = 1/2/3 live; 2.5/4 DEPRECATED; Mode 9 = horizon** — reason: Director ruling 2026-07-20. Mode 9 = absolute autonomy (Director only themes/publication/finance; critics handle brief/casting/script; needs Responsibility Matrix).
- **Mode migration PARKED, not done now** — reason: 2.5 is live in code+DB; migrating now = migrating twice, since Mode 9/Matrix redesign is still being rethought. One airplane, not two.
- **q17a: mechanism home stays in repo `.claude/` for now**, meta-repo extraction later after proving on Sandy — reason: prove-first, avoid premature abstraction.
- **Ran a fresh-eyes audit on our own Layer 0** — reason: independent adversarial check = the anti-drift mechanism applied to itself. It caught a real overclaim (F2) and I verified it (it was also wrong on F1/F3).

